# caravan_confer_witness.rish -- Caravan confer witness.
#
# `entrust.rye` let a supervisor hand a running dependent more work, and it named
# its own limit plainly rather than letting it pass: the dependent was spawned
# holding capability words for its whole reserve, so what grew when the run
# entrusted an arc was the run's PERMISSION, never the dependent's REACH.
#
#   THE REACH ITSELF TRAVELS, AND A DEPENDENT HOLDS ONLY WHAT THE DOOR HAS
#   WEIGHED.
#
# A dependent is spawned narrowed to exactly the line it was handed -- the same
# narrowing `unhand.rye` and `taper.rye` always made -- and the capability
# word for each entrusted arc travels to it over a channel, where it grafts
# the word into its own slot before it reads.
#
# WHAT THIS RUNG PROVES, MEASURED:
#
#   * THE NUMBER THE TWO ROOMS DISAGREE ON IS DARK REACH -- arcs a running
#     dependent could physically touch that the door has not yet weighed. Handing
#     every word at the spawn leaves it at 1; conferring drives it to 0, with
#     the same 3 dependents carrying the same work home either way. This rung
#     buys no speed and no room; it buys the isolation claim itself.
#   * THE DEPENDENT'S OWN HANDS MEASURE IT. Before grafting each conferred word
#     the dependent asks for the arc it names. Handed at the spawn it answers
#     "1 reachable before the word arrived"; conferred it answers 0, because
#     `serve.reach_by_name` genuinely refuses a region its capability list
#     does not name.
#   * A CONFERRED WORD IS DERIVED, NEVER AUTHORED. The run reads the domain's
#     ceiling out of the table `roster.from_system` derives from the
#     declaration, masks it to the letter the reserve declares, renders it in
#     the same `region:perm` grammar the spawn speaks, and reads its own
#     rendering back before publishing it.
#   * THE WORDS LAND BEFORE THE COUNT THAT MAKES THEM LIVE, so a dependent
#     reading between the two sees fewer words than are written rather than a
#     count naming a word that has not arrived.
#   * FIVE REFUSALS THIS RUNG EARNS, AND EVERY ONE IS ABOUT THE WORD RATHER
#     THAN THE LINE. `ConferUngranted` is the region: a ceiling names what a
#     domain may ever reach, so a reserve arc the document never granted it
#     has no word to send. `ConferOverreaching` is the letter: a reserve
#     declaring a write over a region granted read-only would confer a right
#     the ceiling withholds. `ConferGarbled` is the wire: three permission
#     words carry the whole grammar, so a right outside it refuses rather
#     than quietly rendering as something narrower. `ConferOverfull` is the
#     room in the dependent's own hands: one slot holds a bounded number of
#     capabilities, and a graft past that bound is refused before it is sent.
#     `ConferUnheld` is the answer: a run that conferred reach nobody grafted
#     would believe a dependent able to touch what it never took in hand.
#   * THE DOOR ITSELF NEEDS NOTHING NEW. `entrust.admissible_in` weighs a
#     widened line the same way whether the dependent came to hold its arcs at
#     the spawn or over a channel; everything this rung changes stands on the
#     dependent's side.
#   * A RUN THAT CONFERS NOTHING READS AS THE RUNG BELOW, all 9 pairs --
#     this arc's standing generalization test.
#
# All six RED paths were proven on metal before this witness claimed GREEN.
# Drop the region refusal and a word travels for a region the document never
# granted. Drop the letter refusal and a word carries a write the ceiling
# withholds. Drop the wire round-trip and a right outside the grammar renders
# anyway as something narrower. Widen the room bound and a word travels to a
# dependent with no room to hold it. Publish a count of nothing and the run
# refuses the whole record with `ConferUnheld` rather than believing reach
# grafted that never was. Let the dependent skip the graft and it answers
# `NotGranted` on the conferred arc under `on_grant` while carrying fine
# under `at_spawn` -- which is the whole rung, read from the dependent's side.
#
# Checks read the selftest output natively (`contains`), never a shell grep
# over interpolated output -- REDS %76 / %85, the apostrophe loom.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/caravan_confer_witness.rish

let zig = "vendor/zig-toolchain/zig"
let bin = "caravan/bin/confer"

let build = run ["sh" "-c" "mkdir -p caravan/bin && env RYE_ZIG=${zig} rye/bin/rye build caravan/confer.rye -femit-bin=${bin}"]

assert build.ok else "caravan confer build failed"

# The reader this witness runs is built here rather than borrowed (REDS %92).
# Thirty-six rungs ran caravan/bin/read without building it, so the whole arc was
# green only on a tree some earlier run had left warm. A witness owns what it runs.
let read_bin_build = run ["sh" "-c" "env RYE_ZIG=${zig} rye/bin/rye build caravan/read.rye -femit-bin=caravan/bin/read"]
assert read_bin_build.ok else "caravan read build failed -- ${read_bin_build.err}"


# The board declaration the rungs below opened, unchanged.
let published = run ["sh" "-c" "caravan/bin/read caravan/systems/serial_three_clients_board.bron 2>&1"]
assert published.ok else "the board declaration could not be read"
assert published.out contains "domains 4 -- channels 3 -- regions 11 -- grants 22" else "the board declaration changed shape"
assert published.out contains "verdict: whole" else "the board declaration did not read whole"

# A fresh provisioning each run, so every index starts at zero, every bell
# starts silent, and no dependent hears reach conferred by an earlier run.
let clean = run ["sh" "-c" "rm -rf caravan/.regions caravan/.channels caravan/.confers"]
assert clean.ok else "the region stores, doorbells, and conferring notes could not be cleared"

let test = run ["sh" "-c" "${bin} selftest 2>&1"]
assert test.ok else "caravan confer selftest exited non-zero"
assert test.out contains "GREEN" else "caravan confer selftest not GREEN"
assert test.out contains "the reach itself travels, and a dependent holds only what the door has weighed" else "the confer finding did not close"

# The word and its four standing refusals, read straight, before any dependent
# runs. The fifth, `ConferUnheld`, belongs to the run rather than the fold.
assert test.out contains "a conferred word is derived from the ceiling and read back before it travels" else "the derived word was not weighed"
assert test.out contains "four refusals stand by name: ungranted, overreaching, garbled, overfull" else "the four standing refusals did not stand"
assert test.out contains "the reach this rung reads: the word arrives when the door grants it" else "the conferring reach was not named"

# The generalization test: a run that confers nothing reads as the rung below.
assert test.out contains "a run that confers nothing reads as the line handed, all 9 pairs" else "an unconferred run did not read as the line handed"

# The confer lap: one plan run twice, once with every word handed at the
# spawn and once with each word arriving as the door grants it.
assert test.out contains "phases: 4 with every word at the spawn, 4 with the word on the grant" else "the two reaches ran different records"
assert test.out contains "dependents: 3 with every word at the spawn, 3 with the word on the grant" else "the two reaches spent different dependents"
assert test.out contains "carried home as handed: 1 with every word at the spawn, 1 with the word on the grant" else "a dependent did not come home as it was handed"
assert test.out contains "reach conferred: 1 with every word at the spawn, 1 with the word on the grant" else "the run did not confer what it reported"
assert test.out contains "dark reach held at the spawn: 1 against 0" else "conferring closed no dark reach at all"
assert test.out contains "breaks a named turn: 0 with every word at the spawn, 0 with the word on the grant" else "the conferring reach broke an order its author named"

# The dependent measures the finding in its own hands, under both reaches.
assert test.out contains "read 3 arcs of its own, 1 conferred, 1 reachable before the word arrived" else "a dependent handed every word at the spawn reported no dark reach"
assert test.out contains "read 3 arcs of its own, 1 conferred, 0 reachable before the word arrived" else "a dependent conferred its reach could still touch the arc early"

say "GREEN: Caravan confer witness passed."
